# HelpNearby Environment Configuration Example
# Configure values in the AI Studio Secrets panel (or copy to .env, which is git-ignored).
# NEVER commit real API keys or service credentials to version control.

# Supabase Project Configuration (Free Plan):
SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-key

# Optional Google Sign-In Web Client ID (for native Android Credential Manager):
GOOGLE_WEB_CLIENT_ID=your-oauth-web-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com
